.page help 1 a short reminder of the shell

# SYNOPSIS
*help*

# DESCRIPTION
`help` is a gapsh builtin that prints the list of builtins, the main syntax and the line editing keys on a few lines. The full story is in this library: try `patchouli gapsh`.

# SEE ALSO
gapsh(1), gapsh-builtins(7), patchouli(1)
